I excluded the latest commit (`62628c0`, Fiona Formatter's reindent and quote change) with `--ignore-rev`. Otherwise it takes credit for lines it only reformatted. This mostly affects `.js`. In plain blame Troy Goode's `.js` count drops to 517, and the rest of the table looks the same. Troy Goode still leads either way.

Line counts are small, so a handful of lines can flip a ranking. The `.json`, `.gitignore` and extensionless rows are single files.
